OL,3,AUS announces new tariffs on host of
OL,4,Acountries including China
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move comes after the White House's
OL,7,Flaunched an investigation into the
OL,8,Fpractices of its trading partners in
OL,9,FMarch after the US Supreme Court ruled
OL,10,FTrump's previously announced Liberation
OL,11,FDay tariffs were illegal.
OL,13,FChina is facing the highest rate of "up
OL,14,Fto 40%", followed by Vietnam at up to
OL,15,F35% and then others facing either 20%
OL,16,For 25%.
